Usually, I do such things through the app.
But today I am using the website.
There are some instructions on the first page of the website.
I read those instructions carefully.
Users are instructed to log in here.
First, the registered mobile number must be entered.
It is a ten-digit number.
I type my mobile number there.
Following that, it is instructed to provide a static password.
A one-time code is not used here to log in.
I usually forget my passwords.
But this time I remember my password.
I slowly type that password.
Then I press the login button.
